or spread to the CNS

414
00:19:22,450 --> 00:19:24,690
where it forms
granulomas and causes

415
00:19:24,690 --> 00:19:27,110
inflammation leading
to meningitis and its

416
00:19:27,110 --> 00:19:30,250
symptoms. To diagnose
this, you'll often check

417
00:19:30,250 --> 00:19:32,930
in acid fasting,
which uses rhodamine

418
00:19:32,930 --> 00:19:36,010
oramine, a compound
that detects mycolic

419
00:19:41,910 --> 00:19:44,990
or check for
