420
00:19:44,990 --> 00:19:47,710
the CSF. But these
methods cannot

421
00:19:47,710 --> 00:19:50,270
rule out TB as a
cause if they show up

422
00:19:50,270 --> 00:19:52,570
negative. The
gold standard to

423
00:19:52,570 --> 00:19:56,050
diagnose it is with
