structures, but

441
00:20:40,950 --> 00:20:43,370
their presence can cause
deficits of whichever

442
00:20:43,370 --> 00:20:46,130
lobe they are present
in. For example,

443
00:20:46,290 --> 00:20:48,650
a frontal lobe abscess
can cause working

444
00:20:48,650 --> 00:20:50,630
memory difficulty
and problems with

445
00:20:50,630 --> 00:20:53,310
decisions. Temporal
lobe abscesses

446
00:20:53,310 --> 00:20:55,690
