or auditory deficits.

447
00:20:55,930 --> 00:20:58,730
The microbes that cause
abscesses can reach

448
00:20:58,730 --> 00:21:00,970
the brain either by
direct contact in

449
00:21:00,970 --> 00:21:03,710
surgery or trauma,
through the blood after

450
00:21:03,710 --> 00:21:06,950
dental surgery or pre
-existing infection, or

451
00:21:06,950 --> 00:21:08,990
