458
00:21:29,330 --> 00:21:32,510
Diagnosing an abscess
can be tricky. Imaging

459
00:21:32,510 --> 00:21:35,990
like CT or MRI can be
done, and aspirating

460
00:21:35,990 --> 00:21:37,790
the abscess can
also be done, but

461
00:21:37,790 --> 00:21:40,830
this can be invasive.
So it is important to

462
00:21:40,830 --> 00:21:42,990
rule out ****** or
tumor in these cases.

463
00:21:43,590 --> 00:21:46,310
Because abscesses wall
themselves off well

464
00:21:46,310 --> 00:21:48,950
and cause little
inflammation, antibiotics

465
00:21:48,950 --> 00:21:51,590
aren't always effective.
They can't *********

466
00:21:51,590 --> 00:21:53,590
through the abscess and
they can't even pass

467
00:21:53,590 --> 00:21:55,590
by the blood-brain
barrier if there is no

468
00:21:55,590 --> 00:21:58,390
